label sh_ch50:
    label .s1:

        $ set_window_tint(TINT_HISAO)

        call sisterhood_timeskip_broken

        scene bg school_dormhisao_ni
        with nextchapter

        pause 1.5

        nvl clear
        nvl show dissolve

        n "One more day."

        play music music_pearly fadein 4.0

        n "{vspace=30}That thought keeps returning to me as I look around the nearly-empty space of my dorm room. Tomorrow is the day we'll be graduating—the day we'll be leaving the school that I've come to call a second home."
        n "{vspace=30}Over the last few days, the results of various entrance examinations have been slowly coming in. There's a notice board in front of the main school building that's being used to display the results for everyone to see. I've been paying the notice board a visit every day since the school started posting results."
        n "{vspace=30}Not so much for my own results, since those aren't set to come in until tomorrow, but simply to see which of my classmates managed to pass. Two days ago, I learned that Natsume made it through. That's probably a big load off Naomi's mind."
        n "{vspace=30}Yesterday, I found out that Shizune succesfully passed her entrance exam. I can't say I'm surprised about that, given her fiercely driven nature."

        nvl clear
        nvl hide dissolve

        "Tomorrow, the uncertainty will end. The fact that the graduation ceremony is also tomorrow means that the diploma I'll be getting will either be the cherry on top of the cake or a consolation prize that'll do little to take away the utter disappointment I'll be feeling."
        "I remember how apprehensive I felt about coming to live here at Yamaku. How trapped I felt here. Yet now, nearly ten months after I first came to this school, I've grown so comfortable here that the day of departure kind of crept up on me. I tried not to think too much about it."
        "About a week ago, I started making a list of people I thought I should say thanks to before I leave Yamaku tomorrow. The first rule I laid out for myself was that I would not try to write them down in any kind of special order, like least important to most important."
        "Somehow, it ended up like that anyway, though it also ended up being slightly longer than I expected it to be. As I skim it over, my thoughts again go out to all the people I've met here and who became part of my life."

        scene bg suburb_shanghaiint at sepia
        show yuukoshang happy_down at center, sepia
        show lilly basic_smileclosed_close at left, sepia
        show hanako basic_smile_close at right, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.75

        show yuukoshang panic_up
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.5

        show yuukoshang panic_up:
            ease 0.5 offscreenright
        with None

        show lilly basic_surprised_close
        show hanako def_shock_close
        with charachangealways

        "Yuuko... Being an avid reader and Hanako's boyfriend on top of that meant I probably had more interaction with her than most students. I remember her telling me that she was working those jobs at Yamaku and at the Shanghai for the purpose of financing her studies."

        show yuukoshang cry_up at center
        with charamove

        show lilly basic_weaksmile_close
        show hanako emb_downsmile_close
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.5

        "It made me appreciate the fact that my parents have shown willingness to pay for my studies—as long as I make it into university and not spend years at cram schools attempting retakes."

        scene bg school_library_ss at sepia
        show yuuko neutral_down at twoleft, sepia
        show hanako basic_smile at tworight, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.75

        show yuuko closedhappy_up
        show hanako basic_bashful
        with charachangealways

        pause 1.0

        show yuuko happy_up
        show hanako basic_worry
        with charachangealways

        pause 1.0

        show yuuko panic_up
        with charachangealways

        "The last time I spoke to Yuuko, she mentioned that our efforts at passing our tests had motivated her to do well on her own entrance exams."

        pause 0.5

        show yuuko neurotic_up
        show hanako emb_timid
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.1
        show yuuko neurotic_down
        with Dissolve(0.1)
        show yuuko neurotic_up
        with Dissolve(0.1)
        show yuuko neurotic_down
        with Dissolve(0.1)
        show yuuko neurotic_up
        with Dissolve(0.1)
        show yuuko neurotic_down
        with Dissolve(0.1)
        show yuuko neurotic_up
        with Dissolve(0.1)

        show hanako emb_downsad
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.5

        "I wonder if she'll decide to go through with things this year or if we'll have a reunion here in 10 years or so and still find the same Yuuko bumbling her way through the library."

        scene black
        show yuuko neutral_down_close at center
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        "I really hope not. She's a pretty nice person beneath that neurotic exterior, and she's shown so much enthusiasm towards her chosen subject that it'd be downright cruel if she never got to study it in university."

        scene bg school_dormbathroom at sepia
        show steam behind kenji at center, sepia
        show steam2 behind kenji at center, sepia
        show kenji neutral_naked at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.75

        "Kenji... He remains a wildcard to me even today."

        scene evbg kenji_glasses at sepia
        show evmg kenji_glasses_frown at kenji_mg_out, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "There have been times when we were discussing stuff like the law of gravity, and he'd suddenly throw a random conspiracy theory into the conversation completely out of the blue."
        "There have been other times when he'd approach me and just when I started bracing myself for the latest update on the machinations of the feminist movement, he'd simply ask me for my notes on one subject or another."

        scene bg school_scienceroom at sepia
        show kenji neutral at twoleft, sepia
        show muto normal at tworight, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.75

        show muto normal at offscreenright
        with charamove

        pause 0.5

        show kenji rage
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.75

        show kenji happy
        with charachangealways

        show muto normal at tworight
        with charamove

        pause 0.5

        "I used to hold out hope that Kenji's membership in the science club would strengthen his link to reality in general, but it seems that Kenji's perfectly capable of appearing normal in public while still checking the roofs of the nearby buildings for snipers every time he enters his dorm room."

        scene black
        show kenji neutral_close at center
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        "I ended up coping with his antics by dismissing anything related to the feminist movement and simply focusing on whatever he said that did make sense."

        scene bg school_nurseoffice at sepia
        show nurse neutral at center, sepia
        show emi excited_smile_gym at right, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "The head nurse... After taking the entrance exams, I made good on my promise to him by resuming my morning runs, and he made good on his promise to me by supplying me with a training and diet plan."

        show emi excited_smile_gym at offscreenleft
        with charamove

        pause 0.5

        show nurse sinister
        with chchange

        "It was a lot harsher than I expected. Although he denies it, I think this was his revenge against me for not mentioning my heart problems to him sooner during examination hell."

        scene black
        show nurse fabulous_close at center
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        "Still, despite his tendency to crack stupid jokes, he's been a very reliable source of support over the year, and in the end, I'm thankful that he's always been so serious about keeping me healthy."

        scene bg school_scienceclub_desktop at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "Naozumi, Eiji, Wataru, Takahiro, Okahito, and Nobuyuki... The science club—our science club—ended up having a total of eight members, myself and Kenji included."

        pause 0.5

        call screen written_note(_("Little note of thanks to our great prez and the only guy in the country who can talk about quantum physics in a way that makes sense.\n\nNaozumi"))

        pause 0.5

        "Eiji, Naozumi, Okahito, and Takahiro initially joined up because they were getting low grades in science class; they admitted that much to me privately. But they stuck around because they enjoyed the activities."

        pause 0.5

        call screen written_note(_("See you around, Hisao. Hey, did you notice that without you and Kenji, the first letters of the remaining members' names spell out NEWTON? Coincidence? Have a good one.\n\nEiji"))

        pause 0.5

        "Even though Mutou and Lilly were the ones who brought up the idea of teaching as a career, the junior club members I helped with their homework were the ones who made me realize I'd probably enjoy doing that sort of thing for a living."

        pause 0.5

        call screen written_note(_("Eiji, he so totally noticed. He had this shit-eating grin for a week after you joined. Dude is such a dork...\n\n...but also a great president. Folks will miss you, my man. Yours truly included.\n\nWataru"))

        pause 0.5

        "Being stuck in the position of club president has also made me a little less reluctant to take initiatives. I've always been more a follower than a leader, and that's unlikely to ever completely change, but I'm a little less reluctant to take charge when the situation calls for it now."

        pause 0.5

        call screen written_note(_("Thanks for all the tutoring. I don't think I'll ever make a career out of this, but I'm pretty confident I'll at least be able to graduate with good grades next year.\n\nI also appreciate all the dating advice. Mio had a blast during our last outing. I hope you and your girl have a great time at Kasshoku.\n\nTakahiro"))

        pause 0.5

        "In a way, they've helped me as much as I've helped them."

        pause 0.5

        call screen written_note(_("Greatly appreciate the tutoring, Hisao. Can I make a confession? I actually understood the basics of trigonometry pretty well.\n\nIt's just that things were really shitty at home for a while and your company during that time really helped.\n\nStop by whenever you're in the area and lunch will be on me.\n\nOkahito"))

        pause 0.5

        "A few days ago, I transferred the title of president to Nobuyuki, who is one of the few 2nd years in the club and also the one with the biggest knack for the subject. I hope the club will continue to fare well under his guidance. He may even become Mutou's new star pupil."

        pause 0.5

        call screen written_note(_("Kudos to the only man in the cosmos who thinks pi squared factorial jokes are funny.\n\nWalking in your footsteps isn't gonna be easy and I'm not just saying this because of the wheelchair, but I'm gonna do my best to be a worthy successor anyway. I'll miss the bantering sessions.\n\nEnjoy your university years and thanks for everything, President Hisao.\n\nNobuyuki"))

        pause 0.5

        scene bg school_lobby at center, sepia
        show muto normal at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "Mutou... I remember when I met Lilly, she said that my homeroom teacher was quite a character, but that I'd probably come to like him. She turned out to be pretty much spot on."

        scene bg school_scienceroom at center, sepia
        show shizu basic_normal at twoleft, sepia
        show misha perky_smile at left, sepia
        show naomi basic_smile at tworight, sepia
        show hanako emb_smile at right, sepia
        show muto normal at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        play sound sfx_normalbell

        pause 0.75

        show hanako emb_smile at offscreenright
        show naomi basic_smile at offscreenright
        with charamove

        pause 0.1

        show shizu basic_normal at offscreenright
        show misha perky_smile at offscreenright
        with charamove

        pause 0.6

        show muto smile
        with charachangealways

        show kenji neutral at right, sepia:
            xzoom -1.0
        show crowd behind muto at sepia
        with charaenter

        "I never imagined Mutou to become an inspirational figure to me when I first met him, yet that's exactly what eventually ended up happening, and I think that my plans for the future about studying to teach science one day are for a large part due to his influence."

        scene black
        show muto smile_close at center
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        "Seeing that a lot of students seem to think his lectures are incomprehensible, I'll probably have to aim higher than his standard as far as teaching the subject is concerned."
        "But when it comes to being a highly regarded homeroom teacher, I think the example of my mentor will definitely end up sticking in my mind. I hope to return here for a reunion one day with a teaching degree to show him."

        scene bg school_scienceroom at center, sepia
        show shizu basic_normal at tworight, sepia
        show misha cross_smile at twoleft, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show shizu adjust_happy
        show misha cross_laugh
        with charachangealways

        "Shizune and Misha... These two didn't exactly make the best first impression in the world."

        scene ev showdown at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "When I first came to this school there was a lot on my mind that needed to be sorted out, and Lilly's easy-going coaxing strategy worked a lot better at making me feel at home here than Shizune's aggressive recruitment tactics for the student council."
        "It took me a little while to realize that both cousins had been trying to achieve the exact same thing with different methods."

        scene bg school_council at center, sepia
        show shizu adjust_happy at tworight, sepia
        show misha sign_confused at twoleft, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show shizu adjust_smug
        show misha sign_smile
        with charachangealways

        "Despite having been put off by Shizune's confrontational personality at first, I ended up warming up to her and Misha rather quickly, and by the time I started dating Hanako, I considered the student council duo to be genuine friends."

        scene ev shizu_shanghai_normallaugh at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "While I've considered Shizune and Misha to be literally inseparable from the moment I met them, it turned out that they will still be going their separate ways after tomorrow."

        scene black
        show misha perky_smile_close at twoleft
        show shizu behind_smile_close at tworight
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        pause 0.5

        "Through a lot of hard work and supplementary lessons, Misha's managed to do well enough to get herself a recommendation letter from the school, and she's set to transfer to a university in the United States later this year."
        "Shizune, on the other hand, will be spending the upcoming years earning her business degree at a prestigious national university."

        show misha perky_smile at right
        show shizu behind_smile_close at left
        with Dissolvemove(1.0)

        pause 0.5

        show misha perky_weaksmileshort_cas
        show shizu behind_sweet_cas_close
        with charachangealways

        "I think they've been struggling a bit with the prospect of their roads splitting up after graduation, especially Misha. I hope they'll stay in contact with one another. Seeing how close they've been for as long as I've known them, it'd be a shame for them to completely drop out of each other's life."

        scene bg school_track at center, sepia
        show emi basic_grin_gym at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show emi basic_closedgrin_gym
        with charachangealways

        "Emi... I think I owe the fact that I've been in relatively good shape throughout my time at Yamaku (examination hell not withstanding) largely to Emi's efforts."

        show emi excited_happy_gym
        with charachangealways

        show emi at offscreenleft
        with charamovefastest

        pause 0.5

        scene ev emi_run_face at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "My motivation to go through with my daily morning runs has had its ups and downs over the months, but Emi's been there every morning which in turn pushed me to keep going, too."
        "The few times I've skipped practice consistently left me feeling guilty throughout the day, which is probably something Emi'd take as a huge compliment."

        scene bg school_track at center, sepia
        show emi excited_happy_gym at offscreenright, sepia
        with fadeslow

        show emi at tworight
        with charamovefastest

        show emi excited_proud_gym
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.5

        "I also learned that Emi likes playful arguments, and I enjoyed my bantering with her, but unfortunately, I never learned all that much else about her despite seeing her nearly every day."

        pause 0.5

        show emi blur at offscreenleft
        with Dissolvemove(0.5)

        pause 1.0

        show emi at offscreenright

        pause 0.5

        show emi excited_proud_gym at center
        with Dissolvemove(0.5)

        pause 0.5

        show emi excited_laugh_gym
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.5

        scene bg school_nurseoffice at center, sepia
        show nurse fabulous at center, sepia
        show emi basic_grin_gym at right, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show nurse grin
        show emi basic_closedhappy_gym
        with charachangealways

        "Our interactions were pleasant, usually half-joking and perfect to fill the silences between the end of practice and the checkups with the nurse, but I've realized lately that they've also always been a bit superficial."

        scene bg school_hallway3 at sepia
        show lilly cane_smileclosed at left, sepia
        show hanako basic_bashful at twoleft, sepia
        show emi sad_shy at right, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "Around the time preparations for the mock exams were starting, I remember inviting Emi to come and study together with Hanako, Lilly, and me, but she politely declined the offer."

        pause 0.5

        show emi sad_grin at offscreenright
        with charamove

        pause 0.5

        show lilly cane_weaksmile
        show hanako basic_normal
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.5

        "I guess just being running buddies with me was enough for her. At least I've made some good memories together with her, and I hope she feels the same way."

        scene black
        show emi excited_amused_gym_close
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        "According to the nurse, Emi's applied to a junior college in the nearby city with the intention of being a P.E. instructor. I think she'd be a good one, albeit a bit scary sometimes."
        "Apparently the college has a track team of its own. I'm sure she'll do well."

        scene bg tearoom_everyone_noon at sepia
        show tearoom_hisaoe hthink at sepia
        show tearoom_lillye smileclosed at sepia
        show tearoom_hanae shy at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "Lilly... I think it's hard to overestimate the impact that Lilly has had on my life since I transferred here. From the moment I first came to this school, Lilly's been there looking out for me."

        pause 0.5

        show tearoom_hisaoe hsmile
        show tearoom_lillye ara
        show tearoom_hanae happy
        with charachangeev

        pause 0.5

        scene ev lilly_bedroom at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "I don't think I would have gotten into a relationship with Hanako if it hadn't been for Lilly's matchmaking efforts and emotional support."

        pause 0.5

        scene bg city_clubint at sepia:
            center
            xpos 0.6
        show akira basic_smile at sepia:
            center
            ypos 1.06
        show lilly basic_smileclosed_cas at sepia:
            twoleft
            xpos 0.25
            ypos 1.1
        show hanako basic_smile_cas_close at tworight, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "For a long time, I really looked up to her. She always seemed to be so confident, so level-headed and so in control of things."

        pause 0.5

        scene bg hosp_room2 at sepia
        show lilly cane_cry at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "Due to certain events, I came to learn that Lilly's just as prone to screw-ups as everyone else."

        pause 0.5

        show lilly cane_weaksmile
        with chchange

        "But despite the fact that she fell off that pedestal I put her on, I think part of me will always keep seeing her as a kind and reliable older-sister figure to turn to whenever I'm in need of advice or a listening ear."

        pause 0.5

        scene ev planeride_bliss at sepia
        with fadeslow

        "Lilly's been directly involved in several major events in my life: me getting a girlfriend, that big vacation in Scotland, and finally, the decision to study science and aim for getting a teaching degree."

        scene black
        show lilly basic_veryemb_cas_close
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        "I wonder how things will play out between us after we all graduate. If everything goes well, Lilly, Hanako, and I will all be attending the same university, but since we'll be studying at different faculties, there won't be any more shared lunch breaks from now on."
        "At least we'd be able to hang out at Lilly's place in the evening if we wanted to. It'd allow us to continue spending time together. If everything goes well, that is..."

        scene ev hana_library at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show ev hana_library_gasp
        with charachangeev

        "Hanako... In retrospect, things went really fast between us. During our first meeting, I managed to make her so uncomfortable that she ended up fleeing the scene in a panic."

        scene ev hanako_park_away at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show ev hanako_park_closed
        with charachangeev

        "Six weeks later, we got together in the park, letting out that anguished confession that was the start of our relationship."

        pause 0.5

        scene ev hanako_goodend at center, sepia:
            xalign 0.0 yalign 0.0 zoom 1.0
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        scene bg arcade_floor at sepia
        show hanako emb_smile_cas at tworight, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "Despite our rocky start, I've been really happy with Hanako, and from what I could tell, she's been really happy with me as well."

        scene ev hanako_billiards_serious at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show ev hanako_billiards_smile
        with charachangeev

        "It's been truly a sight, seeing Hanako slowly coming out of her shell, first, merely in front of me, but then in front of the rest of the world as well."

        scene bg school_dormhanako at sepia
        show hanako emb_downsmile_clip_close at tworight, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show hanako emb_emb_clip_close
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.2

        show hanako emb_downsmile_clip_close
        with characlose

        "Studying together in her room..."

        scene ev hana_library_read at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show ev hana_library_smile
        with charachangeev

        "...reading together in the library..."

        scene bg school_miyagi at sepia
        show hanako basic_smile at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        "...playing games together..."

        scene bg karaoke_booth at sepia
        show hanako emb_emb_cas_nohat_clip at right, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show hanako emb_downsmile_cas_nohat_clip
        with charachangealways

        "...going on dates together..."

        scene bg inverness_street at sepia
        show hanako basic_smile_sum at center, sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show hanako cover_bashful_sum
        with charachangealways

        $ renpy.music.set_audio_filter("sound", renpy.audio.filter.Highpass())
        play sound [ sfx_camerashutter, sfx_camerashutter, sfx_camerashutter ]

        pause 0.5

        "...going on vacation together..."

        pause 0.5

        $ renpy.music.set_audio_filter("sound", None)

        scene ev funindark_hug_look at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show ev funindark_hug_kiss
        with charachangeev

        pause 0.5

        "...exploring the concept of physical intimacy together..."

        pause 0.5

        scene ev cooldownshower_sigh at sepia
        with fadeslow

        pause 0.5

        show ev cooldownshower_draw_lovey
        with charachangeev

        pause 0.5

        "...basking in the afterbliss together..."

        pause 0.5

        scene black
        show hanako emb_downsmile_cas_nohat_clip_close
        with Fade(0.75, 0.0, 0.5)

        "All of them are wonderful memories I've made with her."
        "But the thing that stands out most among all of those is Hanako's smile. Even though she's started showing it more and more as time went on, it's never lost its charm."

        show hanako emb_smile_cas_nohat_clip_close
        with charachangealways

        "That sweet, child-like smile always manages to brighten my day and make me feel good no matter how often I see it."

        stop music fadeout 4.0

        pause 0.5

        show hanako emb_downtimid_close
        with Dissolve(1.0)

        pause 0.5

        "I just hope I'll ever get to see it again..."

        show hanako emb_downsadmessy_close
        with Dissolve(1.0)

        queue music music_hanako fadein 4.0

        "Part of me probably never believed that Hanako's been secluding herself to such an extreme degree merely because she needed to study for her entrance exams. But for the sake of doing well on my own tests, I blocked Hanako from my mind to the best of my ability."

        hide hanako
        with Dissolve(1.0)

        "Then the entrance exams came and went. Life slowly returned to normal as we started the process of waiting for the results and graduation day to come around."
        "Students who had been cramming non-stop over the last few months had a long night's rest and started resuming their daily activities from before exam season."

        scene bg school_newspaper at sepia
        show natsume hands_cheerful at center, sepia
        show naomi basic_grinclosed at right, sepia
        show jun basic_smileclosed at left, sepia
        with Dissolve(1.0)

        "Natsume returned to Naomi's side at the newspaper club, eager to bring out the next issue."

        scene bg school_council at sepia
        show aoi_keiko at center, sepia
        show shizu adjust_angry at right, sepia
        show mishashort hips_grin at left, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "I started my morning runs again, returned to the science club where I started my preparations of passing the presidential torch to my successor, and spent the rest of my free time helping out Shizune finishing up the student council's duties in time for the swearing in of the new council."
        "Business as usual everywhere, with one exception."

        scene bg school_dormhanako at sepia
        show hanagown remorseful_messy_close at sepia:
            center
            xpos 0.39
        show expression Solid("#00000022") at sepia
        show hanako_door_base at right, sepia
        show hanako_door_door at left, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "Hanako didn't come out of her room to rejoin the daily routine."
        "Ever since the entrance exams ended, I've made it a habit of dropping by at the girls' dorm twice a day. I'd knock on Hanako's door and ask if she needed anything. The answer would usually be a soft 'No, but thanks.' muttered through the door."

        show hanako_door_door:
            xpos -0.19
        with charamove

        pause 0.5

        "She'd rarely open it, and the few times she did, she was always wearing her nightgown, no matter what time of day it was."

        scene bg school_therapist at sepia
        show takawa calculating_close at tworight, sepia
        with fadeslow

        "I recently asked Miss Takawa about it, and she merely said that I should continue what I was doing without trying to force anything. She told me that she's had several talks with Hanako over the last two weeks and that the dormkeeper was keeping an eye on her as well."

        show takawa worried_close
        with chchange

        "Back when I visited her together with Lilly, she had already predicted that Hanako's mood would probably get worse as graduation day drew closer. This time, she said that that day would bring the whole thing to an end."

